WEBVTT

00:07.080 --> 00:10.520
Have you ever heard about that

00:10.520 --> 00:13.900
the cliff of a snow mountain

00:13.920 --> 00:19.590
once fascinated numerous people?

00:20.720 --> 00:23.960
Legend has it that,

00:23.960 --> 00:27.310
there were treasures at the peak

00:27.600 --> 00:33.230
but also there was a bottomless chasm hidden over there.

00:34.280 --> 00:37.740
The smart, the fool

00:37.760 --> 00:41.110
and the kind people,

00:41.200 --> 00:47.590
all are familiar to you.

00:47.920 --> 00:51.780
On the mountainside, on the cliff,

00:51.800 --> 00:54.780
on the cloud,

00:54.800 --> 01:00.470
and in the human world,

01:11.760 --> 01:19.590
snowflakes are drifting profusely and disorderly.

01:30.800 --> 01:34.800
Joy of Life Season 1

01:34.800 --> 01:38.270
Episode 31

01:41.130 --> 01:42.410
Do you want to see me?

01:47.050 --> 01:48.110
What's up?

01:48.130 --> 01:49.990
What is Lin Wan'er

01:50.010 --> 01:51.070
to you?

01:51.090 --> 01:52.480
A wife-to-be.

01:52.500 --> 01:54.310
Do you want to marry her

01:54.330 --> 01:56.390
for Neiku

01:56.410 --> 01:57.840
or for herself?

01:57.860 --> 01:59.280
Even if she's a maidservant

01:59.300 --> 02:00.430
or a slave girl,

02:00.450 --> 02:02.090
I'll marry nobody but her.

02:03.370 --> 02:06.680
So you really fall in love with her.

02:07.500 --> 02:08.920
Are you holding the program

02:09.650 --> 02:10.450
of "Agony Father"

02:10.450 --> 02:11.450
in the middle of the night?

02:11.450 --> 02:12.570
The Princess Royal

02:12.570 --> 02:14.830
has been kneeling outside the Imperial Study

02:14.850 --> 02:16.190
for quite a while.

02:16.210 --> 02:17.160
How do you know about

02:17.180 --> 02:18.070
what's happening in the palace?

02:18.090 --> 02:19.560
That's not the point.

02:20.060 --> 02:23.480
The point is what you should do.

02:24.090 --> 02:25.760
I'd make it up with a kick.

02:27.010 --> 02:29.280
Since the result is already clear,

02:29.490 --> 02:31.320
why don't you be generous

02:31.340 --> 02:33.370
and intercede for her?

02:35.850 --> 02:37.560
Intercede for her?

02:38.450 --> 02:40.880
We should have mercy.

02:40.900 --> 02:42.970
Don't be too ruthless.

02:43.260 --> 02:45.760
Don't drive her too hard.

02:45.850 --> 02:48.760
Insidious as she is,

02:48.780 --> 02:52.040
Li Yunrui has a lot of loyal followers as well.

02:52.060 --> 02:54.400
If you shall have a foothold on the imperial court,

02:54.420 --> 02:55.760
you must learn

02:55.780 --> 02:59.560
the tactic of hardness and softness
to turn enemies into friends.

03:00.450 --> 03:03.120
She tried to kill me!

03:08.060 --> 03:09.610
Fan Xian,

03:10.420 --> 03:12.120
have you ever considered

03:12.140 --> 03:14.330
how Lin Wan'er will feel?

03:14.930 --> 03:16.450
Don't forget

03:17.060 --> 03:20.330
Li Yunrui is her biological mother after all.

03:20.450 --> 03:22.730
You beat Li Yunrui in this round.

03:22.850 --> 03:24.250
What next?

03:24.900 --> 03:26.960
You want to drive her up to the wall.

03:26.980 --> 03:29.330
How would Lin Wan'er think about it?!

03:30.700 --> 03:32.040
If you plan

03:32.060 --> 03:34.200
to get married in future,

03:34.490 --> 03:38.170
will you get estranged because of this?

03:42.260 --> 03:44.040
Fan Xian,

03:44.140 --> 03:46.920
if you're sincere to her,

03:47.570 --> 03:50.840
why can't you yield for her?

03:59.260 --> 04:00.890
Allow me to think about it.

04:03.140 --> 04:04.840
Tonight is the only chance

04:05.260 --> 04:07.760
to intercede if you want.

04:38.090 --> 04:39.440
Auntie,

04:39.490 --> 04:40.460
it's wide spread that

04:40.460 --> 04:41.540
you are on my side.

04:41.540 --> 04:43.250
I am!

04:44.330 --> 04:46.030
If really so,

04:46.050 --> 04:48.070
why don't I have visibility

04:48.090 --> 04:49.970
when you bribed Zhu Ge and contacted Zhuang Mohan?!

04:50.980 --> 04:52.920
If you know all these,

04:53.770 --> 04:55.880
it would be two people

04:55.930 --> 04:57.760
kneeling here now.

04:58.420 --> 05:00.480
Now I have to kneel anyhow!

05:02.050 --> 05:04.880
Please allow me to meet His Majesty!

05:07.890 --> 05:09.240
Your Highness,

05:09.260 --> 05:11.530
it's not good for you

05:12.090 --> 05:13.880
to kneel with me now.

05:25.820 --> 05:27.160
Your Highness,

05:27.460 --> 05:29.720
His Majesty asks you to come in.

05:38.930 --> 05:40.720
Auntie is physically weak.

05:40.820 --> 05:42.760
Please have mercy on her, Your Majesty!

05:42.890 --> 05:44.350
No one else dares to

05:44.370 --> 05:46.150
intercede for her other than you.

05:46.170 --> 05:48.040
Do you know why?

05:48.300 --> 05:50.160
They are afraid to get implicated.

05:50.540 --> 05:52.160
Aren't you afraid?

05:52.580 --> 05:54.470
I can't bear to see her get punished.

05:54.490 --> 05:56.580
Softhearted princes in history

05:56.580 --> 05:58.480
came to no good end.

05:58.860 --> 06:00.160
Your Majesty,

06:00.210 --> 06:02.560
please have mercy on Auntie.

06:02.580 --> 06:04.440
Let's wait a bit more.

06:08.740 --> 06:09.840
For what?

06:09.860 --> 06:11.400
Let's see

06:11.420 --> 06:13.440
if anyone else will intercede for her.

06:14.610 --> 06:16.810
Possibly nobody dares to

06:17.650 --> 06:19.560
as it has come to this point.

06:19.580 --> 06:20.910
Not necessarily.

06:20.930 --> 06:22.070
Your Majesty,

06:22.090 --> 06:23.650
Fan Xian, Chief Musician of the Court of Imperial Sacrifices,

06:23.650 --> 06:25.370
requests for a meeting.

06:25.370 --> 06:26.480
Let him in.

06:32.890 --> 06:34.320
It's such a surprise that

06:34.860 --> 06:37.130
you are here.

06:59.260 --> 07:00.810
Are you here to intercede?

07:02.420 --> 07:03.870
If it weren't for someone else's reminder,

07:03.890 --> 07:05.970
I'd almost forget how Wan'er feels.

07:06.210 --> 07:07.760
They are after all mother and daughter

07:08.090 --> 07:09.800
no matter how much hostility

07:09.820 --> 07:11.350
between them.

07:11.370 --> 07:12.570
So...

07:13.260 --> 07:14.970
To be honest,

07:15.260 --> 07:17.090
it's a bit dis-organized in my mind.

07:17.650 --> 07:18.740
So I found a place

07:18.740 --> 07:20.200
and spent some time sitting there

07:20.540 --> 07:22.530
to straighten it out.

07:23.260 --> 07:25.090
Then I rushed here.

07:25.330 --> 07:27.250
It's not too late anyway.

07:27.490 --> 07:29.880
You are here to intercede for her?

07:38.860 --> 07:41.570
I, Fan Xian,

07:41.890 --> 07:44.280
sincerely beg Your Majesty not to have mercy

07:44.300 --> 07:47.160
and punish Li Yunrui by the most severe means!

07:56.740 --> 07:58.160
Rise!

07:58.540 --> 08:00.350
You don't enjoy kneeling.

08:00.370 --> 08:01.770
If you are really here to intercede,

08:01.770 --> 08:04.250
I'd be very disappointed.

08:05.260 --> 08:07.520
The Investigator's Office

08:07.540 --> 08:08.910
and the power of the Neiku

08:08.930 --> 08:12.920
can only be handed over to someone who can hold
their ground however much pressure they have.

08:13.300 --> 08:15.440
I didn't think that much.

08:18.890 --> 08:20.720
I'm curious about

08:20.890 --> 08:23.690
how you changed your mind.

08:23.820 --> 08:25.440
As I said,

08:26.140 --> 08:27.960
I found a place

08:27.980 --> 08:29.590
and spent some time straightening it out.

08:29.610 --> 08:31.320
Where is the place?

08:33.040 --> 08:39.350
=Tomb of my deceased husband, Teng Zijing=

08:43.730 --> 08:45.240
Now I'm leaving.

08:45.260 --> 08:46.290
Thank you for helping me in the cooperation.

08:46.290 --> 08:47.240
No need to thank me.

08:47.260 --> 08:49.440
Someone wanted to get rid of you

08:49.460 --> 08:50.440
by using the Investigator's Office.

08:50.460 --> 08:50.970
Who?

08:50.970 --> 08:52.330
We're still investigating.

08:53.930 --> 08:55.240
When I arrive in the capital city,

08:55.260 --> 08:56.890
I can figure it out for sure.

08:56.930 --> 08:58.560
The one behind the assassination
attempt is extremely powerful

08:58.580 --> 09:00.710
now that it even dared to do it in public.

09:00.730 --> 09:02.150
If you stay,

09:02.170 --> 09:03.830
this is just the beginning.

09:03.850 --> 09:05.350
The road ahead

09:05.370 --> 09:07.260
will be full of hazards.

09:07.260 --> 09:08.920
In this case,

09:09.490 --> 09:12.080
I'd never leave you alone in the capital city

09:12.100 --> 09:13.950
where you may encounter

09:13.970 --> 09:15.810
both open and covert attacks.

09:17.050 --> 09:18.570
I stay

09:18.730 --> 09:20.690
because I want to.

09:20.780 --> 09:22.470
I won't regret

09:22.490 --> 09:24.400
even if I have to undergo the most severe trials

09:24.970 --> 09:26.890
and lose my life.

09:34.410 --> 09:35.490
If Li Yunrui

09:35.490 --> 09:37.250
only works against me,

09:37.290 --> 09:40.520
I'd yield for Wan'er.

09:40.930 --> 09:42.910
It's not easy to meet someone you truly love

09:42.930 --> 09:44.200
in a life time.

09:44.220 --> 09:45.920
But that's not the only point to consider.

09:46.850 --> 09:49.400
She killed Teng Zijing.

09:49.970 --> 09:50.970
There is no reason for me

09:50.970 --> 09:52.720
to let her go!

09:53.580 --> 09:55.810
If I'd interceded for her,

09:56.290 --> 09:57.640
how selfish will I be!

09:57.660 --> 10:00.010
All for a house guard?

10:01.410 --> 10:03.450
No, it's for a human life.

10:06.370 --> 10:08.710
You're not completely polished.

10:08.730 --> 10:11.330
No one should be polished with
their judgement of right or wrong.

10:14.340 --> 10:15.650
I'm afraid

10:16.340 --> 10:19.250
no one will come to intercede for her.

10:22.370 --> 10:24.160
Let her go!

10:25.580 --> 10:27.080
Thank you, Your Majesty!

10:27.410 --> 10:29.370
Send her far away.

10:29.820 --> 10:32.810
Your Majesty, where shall she go?

10:34.050 --> 10:36.020
She's been in the capital city for so many years.

10:36.020 --> 10:37.780
Xinyang is her fief.

10:37.780 --> 10:39.650
She can go back there.

10:40.900 --> 10:42.210
Your Majesty!

11:05.020 --> 11:07.400
His Majesty wants you to leave the capital city

11:07.730 --> 11:09.570
for Xinyang.

11:10.610 --> 11:12.810
Did Fan Xian come to intercede?

11:13.460 --> 11:16.010
He came to throw a stone.

11:17.220 --> 11:18.690
Fantastic!

11:19.260 --> 11:22.010
I thought he came to intercede.

11:22.170 --> 11:24.480
I was quite worried about that.

11:34.140 --> 11:35.840
Too much luggage.

11:35.900 --> 11:37.100
We should start packing up.

11:37.100 --> 11:38.280
Auntie,

11:39.580 --> 11:41.000
maybe I can try it again.

11:41.020 --> 11:42.770
His Majesty's mind is like an abyss.

11:43.970 --> 11:48.330
It can't be persuaded or guessed.

11:49.050 --> 11:52.130
Whatever happened, she is the Princess Royal.

11:52.220 --> 11:54.810
She can't be sent to the Ministry of Penalty.

11:55.780 --> 11:57.910
Sending her to Xinyang

11:57.930 --> 12:01.570
is already the most severe penalty.

12:02.490 --> 12:04.450
She doesn't deserve to die.

12:04.700 --> 12:06.130
Get out of the way!

13:58.020 --> 13:59.710
Princess, please return!

13:59.730 --> 14:02.840
Her Highness said she doesn't want to see you.

14:03.850 --> 14:05.400
I'll just wait here.

14:05.730 --> 14:07.650
No matter how long you wait, Her Highness won't see you.

14:37.580 --> 14:39.040
She doesn't want to leave.

14:43.530 --> 14:46.130
Shall you meet her?

15:02.220 --> 15:03.850
Given her physical condition,

15:03.850 --> 15:05.810
she will be seriously ill if she stands there for a night.

15:06.490 --> 15:09.250
She will leave if she can't persist.

15:10.100 --> 15:12.320
Her Highness might be weak physically,

15:12.340 --> 15:13.710
but her temper

15:13.730 --> 15:15.330
is just like that of Your Highness.

15:16.220 --> 15:17.680
She won't leave

15:17.700 --> 15:19.650
if she says so.

15:56.730 --> 15:58.370
Come in!

16:28.410 --> 16:30.320
There is freshly made ginseng tea.

16:30.340 --> 16:32.330
Take some to warm up.

16:50.100 --> 16:52.280
Are the maids in the palace all gone?

16:52.850 --> 16:55.080
They are seeking other means of living,

16:55.730 --> 16:57.570
thinking that by changing new hosts,

16:57.820 --> 16:59.720
they can stay in the capital city.

17:00.170 --> 17:01.840
It's not an easy thing.

17:02.020 --> 17:03.920
It is far better than following me.

17:05.930 --> 17:07.960
It is only too indifferent.

17:10.290 --> 17:11.770
Kind-hearted people

17:12.650 --> 17:16.080
have been devoured in the palace.

17:16.100 --> 17:18.050
This is not right!

17:22.410 --> 17:25.840
I shouldn't meet you now.

17:26.340 --> 17:27.930
But since we have met,

17:28.980 --> 17:30.600
I will leave a few words to you.

17:36.460 --> 17:38.170
Now that I have lost,

17:38.980 --> 17:40.680
you still come to see me.

17:42.050 --> 17:44.370
That's a leap into the abyss.

17:46.650 --> 17:48.410
In biological sense,

17:49.290 --> 17:50.870
we are mother and daughter.

17:50.890 --> 17:52.680
It justifies it.

17:53.010 --> 17:54.600
After tonight,

17:55.340 --> 17:57.370
you should pretend that we don't know each other.

17:58.380 --> 18:02.170
Don't come to see me off tomorrow.

18:07.650 --> 18:10.050
Have you betrayed Nanqing?

18:14.650 --> 18:17.800
Does it really matter at this moment?

18:17.820 --> 18:19.270
If you're wronged,

18:19.290 --> 18:21.270
I'll intercede with His Majesty.

18:21.290 --> 18:23.170
Don't you understand the words

18:23.500 --> 18:25.840
I just said?

18:28.740 --> 18:29.960
So,

18:31.930 --> 18:33.290
have you betrayed Nanqing?

18:33.290 --> 18:34.530
I have!

18:34.770 --> 18:37.530
What else do you want to ask?

18:42.170 --> 18:45.500
Did you attempt to hurt Fan Xian?

18:45.500 --> 18:46.930
I did!

18:50.050 --> 18:51.530
You clearly know

18:52.250 --> 18:53.700
he is my fianc矇.

18:53.700 --> 18:54.800
Why?

18:55.700 --> 18:57.600
Are you here to question me

18:57.770 --> 18:59.720
before I leave?

19:01.010 --> 19:02.650
You came to see me

19:03.650 --> 19:04.840
just a few times

19:04.860 --> 19:06.480
ever since I was born.

19:07.890 --> 19:11.050
I thought it must be very difficult for you

19:11.580 --> 19:13.720
and things would become better after I grow up.

19:14.170 --> 19:17.600
Later, I was taken out of the imperial harem

19:17.740 --> 19:19.680
and suffered from severe illness.

19:19.890 --> 19:20.860
You never ever came to see me

19:20.860 --> 19:23.290
in the imperial residence.

19:23.380 --> 19:25.290
When I was seriously ill,

19:25.410 --> 19:26.890
I always wondered

19:27.290 --> 19:28.600
whether you would come

19:29.290 --> 19:31.530
before I died.

19:32.100 --> 19:33.530
Do you even

19:33.700 --> 19:34.740
have me as a daughter

19:34.740 --> 19:36.370
in your heart?

19:37.620 --> 19:39.720
You sabotaged Fan Xian without hesitation

19:39.860 --> 19:42.080
for your fighting of power

19:42.100 --> 19:44.370
because you never cared

19:44.620 --> 19:45.700
and will never care

19:45.700 --> 19:47.320
how I feel.

19:48.740 --> 19:49.740
Why would I care

19:49.740 --> 19:51.250
how you feel?!

19:53.340 --> 19:55.960
Happiness, suffering,

19:55.980 --> 19:58.840
loneliness and sadness.

19:58.860 --> 19:59.650
Who doesn't have these feelings

19:59.650 --> 20:01.800
as long as living in this world?!

20:02.100 --> 20:03.050
But you can only feel them

20:03.050 --> 20:04.930
when you are alive.

20:05.890 --> 20:07.200
Lin Wan'er,

20:07.770 --> 20:09.930
I just want you to stay alive.

20:10.170 --> 20:12.290
I don't care about anything else.

20:17.290 --> 20:19.050
Do you think

20:19.340 --> 20:21.600
what I did is just as simple as

20:21.620 --> 20:23.930
colluding with Beiqi and betraying Nanqing?

20:27.100 --> 20:28.630
Why wouldn't I see you?

20:28.650 --> 20:29.340
Why would I hide from you

20:29.340 --> 20:30.910
and the far, the better?

20:30.930 --> 20:32.270
Because only by doing so,

20:32.290 --> 20:33.910
can you stay out

20:33.930 --> 20:36.050
when it breaks out

20:36.500 --> 20:38.680
and stay alive

20:39.010 --> 20:41.250
while I'm punished by hacking process.

20:44.290 --> 20:46.290
What else have you done?

20:48.620 --> 20:50.320
Stop asking!

20:50.820 --> 20:52.800
You don't need to know.

20:55.130 --> 20:56.770
Live your own life

20:57.820 --> 20:59.870
in future

20:59.890 --> 21:02.170
and take me as a vicious monster.

21:02.340 --> 21:04.050
Stay away from me.

21:04.170 --> 21:05.650
What about Fan Xian?

21:05.860 --> 21:07.910
I told you I like him.

21:07.930 --> 21:09.930
Killing him is also for my good?

21:15.820 --> 21:17.680
If it's not because you like him,

21:18.530 --> 21:20.960
I would not necessarily need to take his life.

21:20.980 --> 21:22.600
Why is that?

21:22.700 --> 21:23.930
As a woman,

21:24.220 --> 21:25.650
you must not only rely on yourself

21:25.770 --> 21:27.510
but also choose the right man.

21:27.530 --> 21:29.200
Choosing the right man is critically important

21:29.220 --> 21:30.860
to the rest of your life.

21:30.860 --> 21:32.560
I've chosen him.

21:33.290 --> 21:35.010
People like Fan Xian

21:35.130 --> 21:37.200
won't end up good.

21:38.740 --> 21:40.480
Why?

21:47.770 --> 21:48.890
Why does His Majesty

21:48.890 --> 21:50.170
get him in the capital city?

21:51.340 --> 21:52.480
To take over Neiku

21:52.500 --> 21:54.410
and the imperial financial power?

21:54.650 --> 21:56.010
What else?

21:56.620 --> 21:57.410
It's very clear that

21:57.410 --> 21:59.320
Fan Xian is very close

21:59.340 --> 22:00.890
to the Investigator's Office now.

22:01.170 --> 22:01.990
Yes!

22:02.010 --> 22:04.230
A lot of people will say he has
enjoyed success when he was young

22:04.250 --> 22:06.050
and has a great future.

22:06.460 --> 22:08.360
But have you noticed that

22:08.380 --> 22:10.360
the Neiku and Investigator's Office

22:10.380 --> 22:11.480
are the forefront for the fighting of power

22:11.500 --> 22:12.770
between the Crown Prince and the Second Prince.

22:12.770 --> 22:15.010
These are the position stared by all eyes.

22:15.250 --> 22:17.270
Fan Xian will become

22:17.290 --> 22:18.010
the most hated person

22:18.010 --> 22:19.990
after he steps on there.

22:20.010 --> 22:21.650
What lurk

22:21.770 --> 22:22.890
in the imperial court

22:22.890 --> 22:24.600
are dreadful monsters.

22:24.820 --> 22:26.290
And Fan Xian

22:26.410 --> 22:28.720
is a bait in the trap.

22:29.500 --> 22:31.560
However glorious he is now,

22:31.580 --> 22:33.750
he will be equally tragic in future.

22:33.770 --> 22:35.390
Under the attacks of dreadful monsters,

22:35.410 --> 22:37.080
what else ending will he have

22:37.100 --> 22:39.320
other than being smashed into pieces?!

22:47.620 --> 22:49.370
If it is merely a marriage contract,

22:50.290 --> 22:52.290
I'd help you cancel it.

22:53.890 --> 22:54.650
But you told me

22:54.650 --> 22:56.290
you like him.

22:57.100 --> 22:58.600
What else can I do?!

22:58.890 --> 23:00.480
If I don't kill him,

23:00.620 --> 23:02.840
I'm sending you onto an unreturnable path.

23:12.410 --> 23:14.110
The good thing is

23:14.130 --> 23:16.290
your sickness is getting better anyway.

23:17.170 --> 23:18.680
After I leave,

23:19.820 --> 23:21.440
find an excuse

23:22.340 --> 23:24.650
and break up with Fan Xian.

23:25.530 --> 23:28.720
I'll think of a way

23:29.010 --> 23:31.560
to cancel the marriage contract for you.

23:38.930 --> 23:41.250
I like him.

23:44.380 --> 23:46.200
Then forget about him.

23:46.770 --> 23:47.600
You like him,

23:47.620 --> 23:49.770
but it doesn't mean you need to die with him.

23:51.530 --> 23:52.250
Do you know

23:52.250 --> 23:54.770
my favorite food?

24:00.010 --> 24:01.840
What do I love to eat most?

24:03.740 --> 24:04.530
Do you know what I like most

24:04.530 --> 24:06.680
in my heart?

24:09.860 --> 24:11.890
I only know staying alive

24:11.930 --> 24:13.750
is the premise of like.

24:13.770 --> 24:15.600
I like eating drumsticks.

24:15.820 --> 24:18.930
You don't know it, but Fan Xian does.

24:19.130 --> 24:20.960
I was stealing drumstick

24:20.980 --> 24:23.050
when he first met me.

24:23.290 --> 24:24.960
I liked the starry sky

24:25.290 --> 24:27.080
at the beginning

24:27.220 --> 24:29.560
because that's the most beautiful scenery

24:29.580 --> 24:31.270
I had ever seen

24:31.290 --> 24:33.960
as I grew up alone.

24:34.130 --> 24:37.150
You don't know it, but Fan Xian does.

24:37.170 --> 24:38.100
I've given him

24:38.100 --> 24:38.930
the deepest loneliness

24:38.930 --> 24:40.480
in my heart.

24:42.170 --> 24:43.630
Once he knows,

24:43.650 --> 24:45.770
I'm no longer alone.

24:45.980 --> 24:48.030
He is what I like most now

24:48.050 --> 24:49.770
in my heart.

24:53.820 --> 24:56.130
If he is stepping onto a path to death,

24:56.580 --> 24:58.600
I'd follow him.

25:20.580 --> 25:22.480
Life is a long journey.

25:24.100 --> 25:28.370
There are more and better things and better people

25:28.620 --> 25:30.840
waiting for you in the future.

25:32.700 --> 25:33.650
If I find a person

25:33.650 --> 25:35.530
to entrust my loneliness,

25:36.250 --> 25:38.290
my life becomes meaningful

25:38.500 --> 25:39.680
no matter it's long or short.

25:39.700 --> 25:40.800
But you don't even have a life,

25:40.820 --> 25:42.770
how come it becomes meaningful?

25:44.820 --> 25:46.440
Didn't you just say

25:46.460 --> 25:48.370
you'll stay away from me

25:48.530 --> 25:50.930
to keep me uninvolved?

25:51.250 --> 25:53.150
Why didn't you

25:53.170 --> 25:54.100
stop doing those dangerous things

25:54.100 --> 25:56.080
for me?

26:04.250 --> 26:06.370
You've chosen your way,

26:08.290 --> 26:10.050
so have I.

26:11.930 --> 26:13.290
You also said

26:13.290 --> 26:14.630
choosing the right man

26:14.650 --> 26:16.440
is the way to survive.

26:17.170 --> 26:18.480
So the man chosen by you

26:18.500 --> 26:19.750
and relied by you

26:19.770 --> 26:21.680
must not be my father, is it?

26:22.580 --> 26:24.050
Who is he?

26:24.290 --> 26:25.870
Who is it

26:25.890 --> 26:28.080
that made you pay so much?

26:55.340 --> 26:57.480
Just one last reminder!

26:58.130 --> 27:01.800
Don't come to see me when I
leave the capital city tomorrow.

27:26.650 --> 27:28.560
Her temper

27:29.340 --> 27:31.530
really resembles mine.

27:45.120 --> 27:48.790
=Capital City=

28:02.480 --> 28:06.190
=Capital City=

28:33.460 --> 28:35.170
Be safe on the way.

28:35.700 --> 28:37.720
I'll visit you whenever I get free.

28:37.740 --> 28:39.480
If you leave the capital city,

28:39.500 --> 28:41.290
Chengze must launch an attack.

28:45.620 --> 28:47.010
Farewell for now!

28:48.250 --> 28:49.720
Go back!

29:19.530 --> 29:21.680
Greetings, Your Highness!

29:21.700 --> 29:22.910
She's already gone.

29:22.930 --> 29:25.030
You don't have to drive her this hard, do you?!

29:25.050 --> 29:26.320
Your Highness,

29:26.340 --> 29:27.840
I'm seeing her off

29:27.860 --> 29:29.840
on behalf of Wan'er.

29:35.530 --> 29:39.130
I don't know anything about what Auntie did.

29:39.740 --> 29:41.320
Of course!

29:56.820 --> 29:58.720
Let him through.

30:13.700 --> 30:16.390
I'm humbly seeing Your Highness off

30:16.410 --> 30:19.050
on behalf of Wan'er.

30:20.500 --> 30:21.910
Thank goodness that

30:21.930 --> 30:24.080
you didn't come to intercede for me.

30:24.100 --> 30:25.530
It seems that Your Highness don't want me

30:25.530 --> 30:26.800
to intercede for you.

30:26.820 --> 30:28.130
No!

30:28.250 --> 30:29.630
If you intercede for me,

30:29.650 --> 30:31.410
I will have no excuse to revenge you.

30:31.820 --> 30:33.320
It's all good now.

30:33.340 --> 30:35.100
I can make some efforts

30:35.100 --> 30:36.390
and prepare something

30:36.410 --> 30:37.510
as a surprise for you.

30:37.530 --> 30:39.080
Save it!

30:39.100 --> 30:41.050
I'm most happy already.

30:41.100 --> 30:41.860
Really?

30:41.860 --> 30:43.130
Yeah!

30:43.220 --> 30:44.990
I once said that

30:45.010 --> 30:47.530
I'll drive Your Highness out of the capital city.

30:47.820 --> 30:49.510
Now it came true.

30:49.530 --> 30:51.560
The happiness in my heart is beyond my description

30:51.580 --> 30:53.770
and I'm in an ever-higher spirit.

30:53.820 --> 30:55.200
To be very honest, Your Highness,

30:55.220 --> 30:55.930
I had half a bowl more of rice

30:55.930 --> 30:57.560
for today's breakfast.

30:57.650 --> 30:59.370
That's good!

30:59.650 --> 31:02.030
Keep a good appetite and take care of your body.

31:02.050 --> 31:03.390
Wait for my return.

31:03.410 --> 31:05.720
If Your Highness returns again,

31:05.740 --> 31:07.960
you may not leave necessarily.

31:08.530 --> 31:11.960
Living in the capital city forever is my wish.

31:11.980 --> 31:13.700
Driving Your Highness out of the capital city

31:13.700 --> 31:16.370
is also my wish.

31:20.220 --> 31:23.440
Please set off, Your Highness!

31:27.410 --> 31:29.050
By the way, Fan Xian,

31:29.700 --> 31:31.650
I prepared a gift for you.

31:35.460 --> 31:36.930
Off we go!

32:10.860 --> 32:13.290
Teng Zijing is probably watching!

32:14.980 --> 32:16.680
It must be so.

32:16.700 --> 32:18.360
It's a pity to just drive her away

32:18.380 --> 32:20.250
and let her live.

32:20.410 --> 32:21.720
Your Excellency, please mind your words.

32:21.740 --> 32:23.600
I didn't say it's her!

32:24.930 --> 32:26.270
Just now I heard

32:26.290 --> 32:27.360
Her Highness said

32:27.380 --> 32:28.990
she prepared a gift for you.

32:29.010 --> 32:30.840
You must be careful!

32:30.860 --> 32:32.250
Let's go!

32:33.980 --> 32:35.320
Your Excellency!

32:39.340 --> 32:40.360
Young Master Guo!

32:40.380 --> 32:41.680
Have you had breakfast?

32:41.700 --> 32:43.600
I won't let you go!

32:46.580 --> 32:47.930
Let's go!

32:50.220 --> 32:52.320
Your Excellency, are we gonna notify the imperial court?

32:52.340 --> 32:53.600
Forget about it!

32:54.220 --> 32:55.130
Is Guo Baokun

32:55.130 --> 32:55.740
the trap she set up

32:55.740 --> 32:57.320
for us?

32:57.340 --> 32:58.250
Li Yunrui's trap

32:58.250 --> 33:00.130
won't be this easy.

33:04.620 --> 33:05.930
Wait!

33:16.340 --> 33:17.720
Why are you here?

33:17.930 --> 33:20.080
She is my mother after all.

33:20.290 --> 33:21.680
I'm sorry!

33:23.050 --> 33:26.030
She wanted to hurt you and
you just tried to protect yourself.

33:26.050 --> 33:27.320
I understand.

33:27.860 --> 33:29.150
You are still willing to see her off

33:29.170 --> 33:31.320
at this time point.

33:31.650 --> 33:33.930
I'm the one who should be thankful.

33:35.290 --> 33:38.960
She said the path you've chosen

33:38.980 --> 33:41.130
will turn yourself into the target of public criticism

33:41.220 --> 33:44.200
which is therefore a dead end.

33:45.170 --> 33:47.170
What I want to tell you is

33:47.980 --> 33:49.650
whichever road you take is fine

33:50.740 --> 33:52.720
as long as you like it.

33:52.860 --> 33:54.800
I'll keep you company.

34:14.920 --> 34:18.380
=Imperial Study=

34:18.380 --> 34:19.730
If it is still about

34:19.730 --> 34:21.470
Fan Xian's leakage of information

34:21.490 --> 34:24.030
that led the seizure of Yan Bingyun,

34:24.050 --> 34:25.880
you don't need to meet His Majesty.

34:25.900 --> 34:27.400
Just give me

34:27.420 --> 34:29.450
your memorials.

34:56.340 --> 34:58.840
Uncle! Master Yuan!

34:59.490 --> 35:01.040
Take a seat!

35:10.580 --> 35:12.000
Master Yuan,

35:12.340 --> 35:15.210
this round of play doesn't hold any promise.

35:23.820 --> 35:25.410
Not good! Not good! Not good!

35:25.690 --> 35:26.990
This move is not good!

35:27.010 --> 35:28.560
You can retract a move?!

35:28.580 --> 35:30.210
His Excellency has retracted dozens of moves

35:30.340 --> 35:32.840
in today's game.

35:32.900 --> 35:34.890
How do you play like that?

35:35.140 --> 35:37.970
Playing the game of Go is like fighting in the battlefield.

35:38.140 --> 35:41.190
Its tricks are exquisite and extraordinary
which are beyond prediction.

35:41.210 --> 35:44.240
That's also the principle of conducting ourselves.

35:44.660 --> 35:46.450
You are still young

35:46.730 --> 35:48.990
and should learn about it from life.

35:49.010 --> 35:50.690
May I ask

35:50.900 --> 35:52.030
whether Master Yuan can retract his moves or not?

35:52.050 --> 35:53.840
Of course not!

35:54.180 --> 35:55.190
Your Excellency is indeed very smart.

35:55.210 --> 35:57.760
Your self-conduct is admiring.

35:58.340 --> 36:02.190
I also want to remind you the fact that

36:02.210 --> 36:05.600
there is not so much fairness in the world.

36:06.180 --> 36:07.360
Sometimes,

36:07.380 --> 36:09.970
it takes a lot of means

36:10.250 --> 36:12.600
to start well and end well.

36:13.010 --> 36:15.120
So Your Excellency's game today

36:15.140 --> 36:17.450
is meant to remind Mr. Fan.

36:18.690 --> 36:19.620
But I don't understand

36:19.620 --> 36:21.360
why you retracted your moves

36:21.380 --> 36:23.280
in the past.

36:26.660 --> 36:27.560
I invite you here

36:27.580 --> 36:29.800
to discuss something.

36:30.010 --> 36:32.600
Li Yunrui lost and left the capital city.

36:32.620 --> 36:34.080
So logically,

36:34.690 --> 36:37.130
it's time to prepare for the wedding

36:37.420 --> 36:39.280
between you and Wan'er.

36:40.660 --> 36:41.800
There is change to the marriage contract?

36:41.820 --> 36:43.690
It's not related to the marriage contract.

36:43.970 --> 36:46.270
A lot of officers from the Six Ministries

36:46.290 --> 36:48.270
submitted memorials to the throne

36:48.290 --> 36:49.880
the other day in the Imperial Study

36:49.900 --> 36:51.420
about your leakage of information

36:51.420 --> 36:54.230
that led to the seizure of Yan Bingyun.

36:54.250 --> 36:58.410
They all required it to be thoroughly investigated.

36:58.450 --> 36:59.140
But it was leaked

36:59.140 --> 37:00.560
by the Princess Royal.

37:00.580 --> 37:04.080
Li Yunrui only admits colluding with Zhu Ge

37:04.340 --> 37:05.990
to gang up for personal interest.

37:06.010 --> 37:07.470
She never admits

37:07.490 --> 37:09.600
giving away Yan Bingyun.

37:11.250 --> 37:13.600
That's her trap.

37:15.820 --> 37:17.280
What did His Majesty say?

37:17.580 --> 37:19.230
He didn't say anything

37:19.250 --> 37:23.840
other than watching the mounting public indignation.

37:27.620 --> 37:28.970
Uncle,

37:29.210 --> 37:30.290
I didn't do anything.

37:30.290 --> 37:31.890
I am wronged.

37:33.210 --> 37:34.970
The truth is not important.

37:35.620 --> 37:37.130
Then what is important?

37:38.490 --> 37:40.410
Your attitude.

37:42.340 --> 37:44.210
I don't understand.

37:46.860 --> 37:48.510
I know a little bit

37:48.530 --> 37:51.210
about His Majesty.

37:51.770 --> 37:53.430
If I don't make it wrong,

37:53.450 --> 37:56.650
he will reach out to you very soon.

37:57.340 --> 37:59.650
Reach out to me? For what?

38:00.340 --> 38:02.600
Whatever he asks you to do,

38:02.620 --> 38:04.080
don't promise him.

38:05.100 --> 38:06.650
He is the emperor.

38:06.690 --> 38:08.600
How can I deny his requirement?!

38:08.620 --> 38:10.750
He didn't make the decision on court.

38:10.770 --> 38:13.080
Naturally it will be determined in private.

38:13.860 --> 38:15.160
Fan Xian,

38:15.180 --> 38:17.370
your wedding with Wan'er

38:17.490 --> 38:19.230
is under preparation.

38:19.250 --> 38:20.800
Once you're married,

38:20.940 --> 38:23.450
I'll transfer you to the Ministry of Personnel.

38:23.660 --> 38:25.640
So don't create any trouble

38:25.660 --> 38:27.560
at this important point.

38:28.420 --> 38:30.120
If it's not a distinct order,

38:30.140 --> 38:31.670
don't promise.

38:31.690 --> 38:33.400
If there should be any trouble,

38:33.420 --> 38:34.750
put it on me.

38:34.770 --> 38:36.370
Is that even possible?

38:39.250 --> 38:44.520
The emperor and the officer are not
like the master and the servant.

38:45.530 --> 38:49.520
They are more like two chess players.

38:52.730 --> 38:55.410
You can lose any chess piece,

38:55.970 --> 39:00.640
but you also need to fight for the necessary.

39:00.660 --> 39:03.520
You didn't do anything wrong in this.

39:04.100 --> 39:05.510
Besides,

39:05.530 --> 39:08.040
in view of your title as the Poetic Genius Fan,

39:08.420 --> 39:10.190
even His Majesty

39:10.210 --> 39:11.490
doesn't have any way

39:11.490 --> 39:13.640
to force you on the court.

39:13.660 --> 39:15.650
But how do you tell

39:15.940 --> 39:16.990
His Majesty will find me in private

39:17.010 --> 39:18.760
to allow me to justify myself.

39:20.210 --> 39:22.130
His Majesty is most interested

39:22.450 --> 39:24.270
in the fight between people

39:24.290 --> 39:25.990
and can handle like nothing.

39:26.010 --> 39:29.510
In his view, you still need more testing.

39:29.530 --> 39:33.170
And now is better than never.

39:34.490 --> 39:36.490
Your Excellency,

39:36.490 --> 39:38.930
Mr. Fan is summoned to meet His Majesty in palace.

39:39.490 --> 39:40.930
There it goes!

39:42.690 --> 39:44.170
Off you go!

39:44.690 --> 39:46.670
Remember what I said.

39:46.690 --> 39:48.100
No matter what you're requested,

39:48.100 --> 39:50.130
don't promise

39:50.490 --> 39:52.410
unless you're clearly requested to with an imperial edict.

39:53.380 --> 39:54.800
I'll have a try.

40:12.900 --> 40:14.370
Lucky!

40:14.820 --> 40:16.170
Master Yuan,

40:17.180 --> 40:18.970
I won again this time.

40:20.490 --> 40:22.240
There is still room left.

40:28.290 --> 40:30.240
My bad! My bad! My bad!

40:34.290 --> 40:36.280
It's OK now.

40:39.820 --> 40:41.520
You won!

40:51.530 --> 40:54.930
Your Highness! Your Highness!

40:57.490 --> 40:58.800
This is...

40:58.820 --> 41:01.730
Your Excellency! Please take a seat.

41:02.380 --> 41:03.800
This side please.

41:05.530 --> 41:07.800
What's going on?

41:08.050 --> 41:10.040
I don't know either.

41:11.580 --> 41:13.050
His Majesty summoned us

41:13.050 --> 41:15.040
and didn't tell us why.

41:15.140 --> 41:17.520
It's hard to tell if it's good or bad.

41:18.250 --> 41:21.690
His Majesty's will is deep and unpredictable.

41:21.820 --> 41:24.800
Don't even try to guess His Majesty's will.

41:25.940 --> 41:28.430
Your Highness is reasonable and loyal

41:28.450 --> 41:31.930
which is very admiring.

41:32.420 --> 41:33.470
What do you think?

41:33.490 --> 41:35.190
It's a contest between Your Highnesses.

41:35.210 --> 41:36.800
I'd rather stay impartial.

41:38.210 --> 41:39.660
Only you

41:39.660 --> 41:41.370
dare to say anything you want.

42:20.290 --> 42:22.470
Your Majesty, everyone is here.

42:22.490 --> 42:24.370
We can start the meal.

42:34.490 --> 42:36.320
This is a family meal.

42:36.450 --> 42:39.840
Help yourselves!

42:43.290 --> 42:44.600
Your Majesty,

42:44.860 --> 42:46.190
since it's a family meal,

42:46.210 --> 42:47.640
my presence is improper.

42:47.660 --> 42:49.930
You're thick-skinned. It's alright!

42:50.900 --> 42:52.240
Go ahead with it!

43:18.000 --> 43:21.580
In the river of history,

43:21.600 --> 43:25.070
time goes round and round.

43:27.880 --> 43:31.220
Memories about the former and present lives

43:31.240 --> 43:35.310
join each other in an endless way.

43:37.200 --> 43:39.820
In the long drunken Milky Way,

43:39.840 --> 43:42.080
one season follows another in a flash,

43:42.080 --> 43:44.580
and the wild geese are flying south.

43:44.600 --> 43:46.200
I just can't give up

43:46.200 --> 43:49.540
to be with you for my whole life.

43:49.560 --> 43:55.030
I have been hovering in the dreams
for hundreds and thousands of times.

43:56.280 --> 43:58.830
I can't even say a word when I watch the flowers falling.

43:59.120 --> 44:01.160
Year after year in the wandering,

44:01.160 --> 44:03.820
I count the remaining years.

44:03.840 --> 44:06.020
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:06.040 --> 44:08.030
even though we have ended up the destiny,

44:08.320 --> 44:10.710
I never feel regretful.

44:10.760 --> 44:12.120
In such a chaotic world,

44:12.120 --> 44:15.100
I still miss you as ever.

44:15.120 --> 44:18.070
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:18.360 --> 44:20.420
With a gentle heart,

44:20.440 --> 44:23.100
I cherish our remaining years.

44:23.120 --> 44:24.640
Even though we have to go through

44:24.640 --> 44:27.150
all the hardships along the journey,

44:27.280 --> 44:34.470
you always stay by my side,

44:34.560 --> 44:37.230
watching the falling flowers, speechlessly.

44:37.520 --> 44:39.600
Year after year in the wandering,

44:39.600 --> 44:42.260
I count the remaining years.

44:42.280 --> 44:44.420
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:44.440 --> 44:46.670
even though we end up the destiny,

44:46.880 --> 44:49.060
I never feel regretful.

44:49.080 --> 44:50.480
In such a chaotic world,

44:50.480 --> 44:53.540
I still miss you as ever.

44:53.560 --> 44:56.670
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:56.760 --> 44:58.900
With a gentle heart,

44:58.920 --> 45:01.620
I cherish our remaining years.

45:01.640 --> 45:03.080
Even though we have to go through

45:03.080 --> 45:05.740
all the hardships along the journey,

45:05.760 --> 45:14.520
you always stay by my side...
